            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention provides a pharmaceutical composition comprising:a biodegradable multi-branched copolymer comprising at least three polyester arms attached to a central core which comprises a polyether, and wherein the multi-branched copolymer is substantially insoluble in aqueous solution, further comprising at least one pharmaceutically active ingredient.</p>
